  "notes": "USAGE: {発達|はったつ} is used for organic growth and development (children, brains, weather systems) as well as technological/societal progress.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{発達|はったつ}する (to develop, to grow)\n・{発達|はったつ}した (developed, advanced)\n・{発達|はったつ}{段階|だんかい} (developmental stage)\n・{発達|はったつ}{障害|しょうがい} (developmental disorder)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{発達|はったつ}{心理|しんり}{学|がく} (developmental psychology)\n・{発達|はったつ}{段階|だんかい} (developmental stage)\n・{発達|はったつ}{障害|しょうがい} (developmental disorder)\n・{身体|しんたい}{発達|はったつ} (physical development)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{発展|はってん} - development (broader, societal/economic)\n・{成長|せいちょう} - growth (increasing in size)\n・{進歩|しんぽ} - progress, advancement",
